      "label": "Islamophobia",
      "description": "A form of prejudice or discrimination against Muslims, often manifesting as the belief that Muslims are inherently violent or dangerous. The meme relies on this prejudice by implying that Syrian migrants (many of whom are Muslim) are untrustworthy. This is a real-world concept that is not visible in the image but is essential to understand the meme's harmful intent.",
