      "label": "contemptuous expression",
      "description": "Justin Trudeau's facial expression, characterized by a slight upward tilt of the lips and a narrowed gaze, conveys a subtle sense of disdain or superiority, which is ironically juxtaposed with the inflammatory and absurd claims in the text. This expression is not overtly aggressive but carries an undertone of condescension, aligning with the meme's tone of moral superiority and false equivalence.",
